file_operations.description:
Add form submission handler that constructs a WhatsApp message in the exact format: 'Hello TrustFix,
I want to book a service.

Name: {Customer Name}
Phone: {Mobile Number}
Address: {Address}
Service: {Service Name}
Property Type: {Property Type}
Date: {Date}
Time: {Time}
Notes: {Notes}

'. Use encodeURIComponent to URL-encode the entire message text. Open window.open(`https://wa.me/918884447229?text=${encodedMessage}`, '_blank') on form submission. After opening WhatsApp, close the popup by calling the onClose prop. Do not show any thank-you message or navigate away from the current page.
